'''Wugachug''' is the hometown of the [[Chugawugs]]. Several [[Quests|quests]] related to the Sasparilla Brewery are started here. Because of it's location north, it has slight signs of snow around. It is right next to [[Snowhill]], and [[Seaside]]. Below is [[Merry Vale]]. The town itself resembles a carnival, as it has a carnival tent, stage, shops, etc.
[[File:Wugachug..png|thumb|300px]]
